<title>FRANCE: Yeltsin, Britain's Blair to meet in Paris.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin, Britain's Blair to meet in Paris.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin will have his first private meeting with Britain's new Prime Minister Tony Blair on Tuesday, Yeltsin's spokesman Sergei Yastrzhembsky said on Monday.</p>
<p>The two men, in Paris for the signing of a landmark treaty between NATO and Russia, will meet over breakfast at the Russian embassy.</p>
<p>Blair was swept to power on May 1 in a Labour Party landslide which ended 18 years of conservative rule.</p>
</text>
